config BR2_PACKAGE_OPENABL
	bool "openabl"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  OpenABL, an open replacement for the Qualcomm Android bootloader (ABL) of the AYN Thor and other SM8550
	  handhelds: it starts a Linux kernel's EFI stub from the SD card. The build only copies the release's
	  signed image for SM8550 to the boot partition's openabl/ folder; it is flashed once, by hand, from Android
	  or fastboot (board/thor/openabl-README.txt). The release ROCKNIX pins.

	  https://github.com/OpenHandheldCollective/OpenABL
